# Everything below can contain real ticket keys, names and email addresses.
# Nothing here belongs in a public repository.
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.html
.env

# Captured API responses, kept only while debugging. Test fixtures are
# hand-written and synthetic; see tests/fixtures/README.md.
*.raw.json

__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# SDD workspace: scratch reports that quote leak terms as test data.
# Never publishable, and never needed by a reader of this repo.
.superpowers/

# Claude Code's auto-loader walks UP from cwd and needs a CLAUDE.md at
# the root to pick up project context. The stub just imports the two
# TRACKED docs (AGENTS.md, CONTEXT.md), so it carries nothing itself
# and stays local. There is deliberately no /CONTEXT.md or /AGENTS.md
# rule here: those are repo state, and an ignore rule for either would
# silently untrack them.
/CLAUDE.md
